{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Interviewcollectie Stichting Mondelinge Geschiedenis Indonesië, interview 1215"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:48638"}},{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Resp_Interviewnummer 1215.1"}},{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Resp_Interviewnummer 1215.2"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Stichting Mondelinge Geschiedenis Indonesië (SMGI)"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Koninklijk Instituut voor Taal-, Land- en Volkenkunde (KITLV)"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"KITLV  Archives"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"KITLV \/ Leiden Universiteit UB"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Dit interview bestaat uit twee gesprekken: 1215.1 en 1215.2.<\/p><p>1215.1 De geïnterviewde vertrok in 1939 als militair naar Indië. Hij vertelt over de gelaagdheid in de samenleving en beschrijft het dagelijks leven. Hij beschrijft hoe de overmacht van de Japanners duidelijk werd. De geïnterviewde werd krijgsgevangene gemaakt. Als leidinggevende officier bevond hij zich in een sterke positie naar de Japanners toe. Na de bevrijding ging de geïnterviewde meteen weer aan de slag en vervolgde zijn leidinggevende functie in het leger eerst in Indië, en vervolgens in Nederland.<\/p><p>1215.2 De geïnterviewde vertelt over zijn KMA-opleiding en gaat in op de werking van het KNIL. Hij vertelt hoe de aanloop van de overmacht van de Japanners er uit zag. Tot slot beschrijft hij hoe tijdens de krijgsgevangenschap de hiërarchie van het KNIL nog steeds heerste.<\/p><p>De echtgenote van de geïnterviewde is ook geïnterviewd voor het SMGI-project. Zie interview 1198. (Zie het veld 'relation').<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Date Submitted: 2012-02-03"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"dekolonisatie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"oral history"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"koloniale samenleving"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Japanse bezetting"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Japanse capitulatie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Bersiap"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"interneringskampen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"KNIL"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Nederlands Indië"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Indonesische onafhankelijkheid"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"1998-01-27"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Fridus Steijlen (coördinator)"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2011-08-24"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2012-02-03"},{"typeName":"series","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"seriesInformation":{"typeName":"seriesInformation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Deze dataset bevat de metadata van de interviewcollectie Stichting Mondelinge Geschiedenis Indonesië.<br>Een groep wetenschappers uit verschillende disciplines nam in 1994 het initiatief om de verhalen en ervaringen van mensen, die de turbulente laatkoloniale en vroeg-postkoloniale tijd tussen 1940-1962 in Nederlands-Indië, Indonesië of Nieuw-Guinea hadden meegemaakt, vast te leggen nu het nog kon. Men koos ervoor om geen onderzoeksproject op te zetten, maar om zich te concentreren op het verzamelen van de verhalen van mensen vanuit archiveringsoogpunt als basis voor toekomstig onderzoek. Tussen 1997 en 2001 zijn er 1190 interviews met 724 mensen opgenomen, in totaal 2800 uur aan geluidsmateriaal.<\/p><p>Een overzicht van het project en de interviews in EASY vindt u onder 'Data files'.<\/p><p>De interviews worden bij DANS duurzaam bewaard, maar worden (voorlopig) door het KITLV zelf ontsloten. Zie het veld 'Relations' voor een link naar de collectie op de KITLV-website.<\/p>"}}]}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Unknown"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Unknown"},{"typeName":"dansMetadataLanguage","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]}]},"dansRelationMetadata":{"displayName":"Relation Metadata","name":"dansRelationMetadata","fields":[{"typeName":"dansAudience","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D30000","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34000","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D60000"],"expandedvalue":[{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D30000","termName":[{"lang":"nl","value":"Geesteswetenschappen"},{"lang":"en","value":"Humanities"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"},{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34000","termName":[{"lang":"nl","value":"Geschiedenis"},{"lang":"en","value":"History"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"},{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D60000","termName":[{"lang":"en","value":"Social sciences"},{"lang":"nl","value":"Sociale wetenschappen"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"}]},{"typeName":"dansCollection","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/cf8c960a-aa0f-4ee3-a7b0-4a3c847669e6","https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/cfa04ed6-4cd0-4651-80cb-ed4ca8fa14f3"],"expandedvalue":[{"@id":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/cf8c960a-aa0f-4ee3-a7b0-4a3c847669e6","vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections"},{"@id":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/cfa04ed6-4cd0-4651-80cb-ed4ca8fa14f3","vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections"}]},{"typeName":"dansRelation","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","